# Settings (SETTINGS.PRG) on the Desktop (DESK=1: no NODESK), opened from the Terminal:
#   DESK=1 sh tests/shots.sh EMU SD settings 22 8.8 10.4 12.4 17.2 20.5
# Good shot times (s), total 22 s:
#   8.8  the panel as it opens (default teal, mouse 1, delay 0.4 s, medium rate, volume 8)
#   10.4 "forest" clicked: the desktop is green at once
#   12.4 "wine" clicked: the desktop is wine red
#   17.2 delay 0.6 s, rate Fast, volume 10 (two clicks on the scroll bar's right arrow),
#        an "x" held for 1.2 s in the "Try here" field (it repeats)
#   20.5 after Save: the panel is closed, the desktop stays wine; /SYSTEM/CONFIG written
# The pointer starts at (320, 180); moves of at most 100. The panel's content is at
# (140, 72) on the screen.
# Programs menu (100, 8) > Terminal (fourth item, y 66)
3000 M -100:-100:0:0
+50 M -100:-72:0:0
+50 M -20:0:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
+500 M 0:58:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
6000 settings\n
# the fourth swatch (forest) at (334, 94)
9000 M 40:28:0:0
+50 M 100:0:0:0
+50 M 94:0:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
# the seventh (wine) at (406, 94)
11000 M 72:0:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
# Repeat delay 0.6 s (460, 154), Repeat rate Fast (450, 182)
13000 M 54:60:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
+500 M -10:28:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
# Beep volume: the scroll bar's right arrow (393, 238), twice
+500 M -57:56:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
# hold "x" in the Try here field (it has the focus) for 1.2 s
15500 {d1b}
+1200 {u1b}
# Save (456, 310; 0.18: below the new Sound volume row)
18000 M 63:72:0:0
+300 M 0:0:0:1
+100 M 0:0:0:0
